        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey 255, 96mm Narrow Delano Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to care for and oh so stylish, the 5 Inch Narrow Delano Cabinet Pull is the ideal cabinet hardware for your remodel. This affordable cabinet pull is sleek and is available in popular finish colors. The  96mm Narrow Delano Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Delano\">Laurey Delano Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Delano Narrow Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n<li>Also Available in  a <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-inch-narrow-delano-cabinet-pull-laurey-254\">Smaller 3-1/2 Inch Size</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
